{"kind": "deco", "attachment": null, "findings": [{"level": "error", "title": "1 voxel is almost black", "body": "Trove's style guide asks for nothing darker than (10, 10, 10) - pure black reads as a hole in game. Use a dark grey instead.", "voxels": [2]}], "satisfied": ["A blueprint stores one material per voxel, so alpha-on-solid and specular-on-glass - two of the classic .qb mistakes - can't happen here."], "counts": {"error": 1, "warning": 0, "info": 0}}